<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #FFF9F2;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            border: 1px solid #FFEBD6;
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E67E22, #C45C1A);
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #5D4037;
        }
        .content p {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .otp-box {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #FFF9F2;
            border: 2px dashed #E67E22;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #C45C1A;
            letter-spacing: 5px;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #F8F9FA;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #888;
        }
        .brand-color {
            color: #E67E22;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Halwa Kadai</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello,</p>
            <p>Welcome back! Use the verification code below to securely sign into your <span class="brand-color">Halwa Kadai</span> account.</p>
            
            <div class="otp-box">
                [[OTP_CODE]]
            </div>

            <p style="margin-top: 25px; font-size: 14px; color: #888;">
                This code is valid for the next 10 minutes.<br />
                If you didn't request this, please ignore this email.
            </p>
            
            <p style="margin-top: 30px;">
                Regards,<br />
                <strong>The Halwa Kadai Team</strong>
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            © 2026 Halwa Kadai. Deliciously Traditional.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>